{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"4e24a3b0-6e6b-49bd-9748-21d868294f59":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_3xrYLq":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"d5d2323d-4447-414d-8f12-2e11f9036b3e":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_VaJMc8":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Try other fruity flavours","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["passionfruit","roasted-apple"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>Savour the fresh taste of our <em>Blood Orange<\/em> Moonshine. Full of bright citrus flavours, O'Donnell Blood Orange offers a captivating spirit that combines the zesty tang of blood oranges with smooth Moonshine. Sweet, refreshing and blissful. From summer spritzers to fruity cocktails, you simply can't go wrong with this one.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs,<\/a> have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>Curious? Simply order your Blood Orange Moonshine today and we'll ship it to anywhere within mainland UK within a few working days.<\/p><p><strong>Please note: All of our products are shipped in branded boxes.<\/strong><\/p>","page":""}},"58400cf8-e650-467e-8b8e-590606422b43":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"Moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"Pouring Lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Blood Orange & Tonic<\/h3><h4>Ingredients<\/h4><ul><li>50ml Blood Orange<\/li><li>Top with Tonic Water<\/li><li>Fresh Berries<\/li><\/ul><h4>Recipe<\/h4><ol><li>Add ice to a tall glass. Pour in Blood Orange and fill up with Tonic Water.<\/li><li>Briefly stir and then top with fresh berries.<\/li><li>Serve and enjoy!<\/li><\/ol><p>You can find more recipes in our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktails blog<\/a>!<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"ec1b1391-2ea5-46b3-9ace-b333f4f99398":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. <\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","4e24a3b0-6e6b-49bd-9748-21d868294f59","price","description","variant_picker","da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_3xrYLq","d5d2323d-4447-414d-8f12-2e11f9036b3e","recommended_products_VaJMc8","collapsible-row-2","58400cf8-e650-467e-8b8e-590606422b43","collapsible-row-3","collapsible-row-1","ec1b1391-2ea5-46b3-9ace-b333f4f99398","collapsible-row-0"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Fresh Fruit Flavour","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"